From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:31:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Define PROPID for GDI+

TinyCC's Windows headers have no propidl.h, which defines the property
identifier GDI+ uses.
---
 gdiplus/gdiplus.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/gdiplus/gdiplus.h b/gdiplus/gdiplus.h
index 79366ea..f365080 100644
--- a/gdiplus/gdiplus.h
+++ b/gdiplus/gdiplus.h
@@ -49,6 +49,7 @@ namespace Gdiplus {
 typedef float REAL;
 typedef SHORT INT16;
 typedef WORD UINT16;
+typedef ULONG PROPID;
 
 #include "gdiplusenums.h"
 #include "gdiplustypes.h"
